					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Even though it's a really &quot;obvious&quot; joke that could easily fall flat, a few details saved it for me: I absolutely LOVE how they assess researcher Senrab Noremac as aggressive, and the highly advanced 3D-chess move of strapping a drone on top of another drone.</p> <p>It's actually thought-provoking about how switching to an &quot;investigating anomalies&quot; mode warps your judgement, and about what it feels like to be a moth.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
