				<wikidot:authorName>mayoculpa</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3489662</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 I did not see this coming at all. Even though <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">a&nbsp;similar&nbsp;thing&nbsp;once&nbsp;happened&nbsp;to&nbsp;me&nbsp;in&nbsp;real&nbsp;life.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">a&nbsp;similar&nbsp;thing,&nbsp;hide&nbsp;it&nbsp;again.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>Elderly customer: Can you get me half a pound of that Hawaiian salad?</p> <p>Me, a deli clerk: Can do!</p> <p>Customer: No, not <strong>that</strong> Hawaiian salad. The other one, the one next to it. It looks much better.</p> <p>Me: Oh, the banana pudding?</p> <p>Customer: No! The <strong>other Hawaiian salad</strong>, it's right there!</p> <p>Me: &#8230; it's a mirror, ma'am.</p> <p>Customer: What? I can see it, it's right there.</p> <p>Me: <strong>It's a mirror, ma'am.</strong></p> <p><em>I reach inside the case and tap the glass with the serving spoon.</em></p> <p>Customer: Oh.</p> </blockquote> <p>The customer was a really good sport about it once she realized her mistake. But I bet that's far from the only time something like that has happened.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
